Bundle-Name: Fennec Services Telemetry Demo
Bundle-Description: \
	What a presentation needs and a deployment does not: the \
	configuration that points the OpenTelemetry SDK at the collector of \
	the observability stack. \
	\
	A bundle rather than `configurator.initial`, for the reason the \
	harness configuration bundle gives: the initial property is parsed \
	before the JSON provider is up. \
	\
	Configuration and nothing else, so that a framework which only \
	needs to report telemetry — the broker, a provider — does not also \
	have to install a consumer SDK it never uses. The traffic generator \
	is a bundle of its own for that reason.

-includeresource: \
	OSGI-INF/configurator/=configs/
Require-Capability: osgi.extender;filter:='(osgi.extender=osgi.configurator)'
